    "With the economy log on, an item a CoA system hands out directly writes one reward row with the item, its count and the system as source.",
    "The final boss of normal Scarlet Monastery - Graveyard (Bloodmage Thalnos 4543) gives a level 30 player outside the Dungeon Finder one Dungeon Spoils 2021814: source 5 (dungeon boss). Opening the spoils gives one dungeon item: one cache_open row with the spoils as source.",
    "Outside the Dungeon Finder the Heroic final boss gives one Heroic Dungeon Spoils 1202039 (Mythic+ module): source 5. Opening them (item_coa_dungeon_spoils) gives their dungeon item: cache_open rows with the spoils as source.",
    "A Heroic dungeon boss kill (Anub'shiah 9031, Blackrock Depths) gives one Mark of Triumph 1414502: source 5.",
    "Capturing a Void Portal (gameobject 239828) gives Voidtalon of the Dark Star 121815: source 6 (Void Portal).",
    "A second capture (spawn 8001309) by a player whose bags are full mails the Voidtalon: one reward row (source 6) written with the mail and the mail's own system_mail row, nothing twice."
  ],
